  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-15",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "体面的告别  (A Dignified Farewell)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Meeting Xin Huimei by the water after his return, Chun Yuqiao offers to request leave so he can keep her company, unaware she has already made a decision. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你这次来得太匆忙了，我看看过两天能不能请假陪你到处转一转。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "以后你都不用陪我了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你刚才说什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我订了出国的机票，明天就走，过段时间还会去进修，短期内不会回国了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是我有什么地方做得不好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不，你特别好，只是这段时间我想了很久。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我们一起经历过这些事，我看到各种各样的你，觉得我不是适合你的那个人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不管发生任何事情，我心里永远都会记得你对我的好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我就想好好地保护你，不让你再受伤害。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "为什么不管我说什么，你都这么认真呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是辛惠美，我不需要任何人保护我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我一定会幸福的，我相信你也会的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你这次来得太匆忙了，我看看过两天能不能请假陪你到处转一转。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your visit this time was so rushed; let me see if I can take leave in two days to show you around.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "以后你都不用陪我了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From now on, you will not need to keep me company anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你刚才说什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did you just say?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我订了出国的机票，明天就走，过段时间还会去进修，短期内不会回国了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I booked an international flight leaving tomorrow, and later I will study abroad, so I will not be back anytime soon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是我有什么地方做得不好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did I fall short in some way?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不，你特别好，只是这段时间我想了很久。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, you have been wonderful; I have simply thought long and hard lately.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我们一起经历过这些事，我看到各种各样的你，觉得我不是适合你的那个人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Going through all these things together and seeing every side of you made me realise I am not the right person for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不管发生任何事情，我心里永远都会记得你对我的好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whatever happens, my heart will always remember how kind you have been to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我就想好好地保护你，不让你再受伤害。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All I wanted was to protect you well so you would never get hurt again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "为什么不管我说什么，你都这么认真呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do you take every single thing I say so seriously?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是辛惠美，我不需要任何人保护我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am Xin Huimei—I do not need anyone to protect me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我一定会幸福的，我相信你也会的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will definitely find happiness, and I believe you will too.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你这次来得太匆忙了，我看看过两天能不能请假陪你到处转一转。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "以后你都不用陪我了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你刚才说什么？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我订了出国的机票，明天就走，过段时间还会去进修，短期内不会回国了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是我有什么地方做得不好吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不，你特别好，只是这段时间我想了很久。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我们一起经历过这些事，我看到各种各样的你，觉得我不是适合你的那个人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不管发生任何事情，我心里永远都会记得你对我的好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我就想好好地保护你，不让你再受伤害。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "为什么不管我说什么，你都这么认真呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是辛惠美，我不需要任何人保护我。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我一定会幸福的，我相信你也会的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Declaring she needs no one's protection out of pity, Xin Huimei parts with Chun Yuqiao on warm, dignified terms and wishes him happiness. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
